    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy life on your small farm</strong></h2>You have a lot of work to do. Plant, water, and harvest. This cozy and peaceful farm nestled in the heart of the forest has much to offer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/a71c695ddb22ef344c7b752ba3054c9b.poster.avif?t=1739795156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/a71c695ddb22ef344c7b752ba3054c9b.webm?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/a71c695ddb22ef344c7b752ba3054c9b.mp4?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax with some fishing</strong></h2>Need a break? Fishing is just what you need! It's also a great way to earn some extra money.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/6eec6b71e6252736ba4dfa1f80bf6a3a.poster.avif?t=1739795156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/6eec6b71e6252736ba4dfa1f80bf6a3a.webm?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/6eec6b71e6252736ba4dfa1f80bf6a3a.mp4?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of the darkness</strong></h2>Perhaps things weren\u2019t as pleasant as they seemed, it's become a bit eerie.<br>Will you manage to survive? It won't be easy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/9e3d4111f28b78b8df5af54693c827d4.poster.avif?t=1739795156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/9e3d4111f28b78b8df5af54693c827d4.webm?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/9e3d4111f28b78b8df5af54693c827d4.mp4?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy life on your small farm</strong></h2>You have a lot of work to do. Plant, water, and harvest. This cozy and peaceful farm nestled in the heart of the forest has much to offer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/a71c695ddb22ef344c7b752ba3054c9b.poster.avif?t=1739795156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/a71c695ddb22ef344c7b752ba3054c9b.webm?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/a71c695ddb22ef344c7b752ba3054c9b.mp4?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relax with some fishing</strong></h2>Need a break? Fishing is just what you need! It's also a great way to earn some extra money.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/6eec6b71e6252736ba4dfa1f80bf6a3a.poster.avif?t=1739795156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/6eec6b71e6252736ba4dfa1f80bf6a3a.webm?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/6eec6b71e6252736ba4dfa1f80bf6a3a.mp4?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of the darkness</strong></h2>Perhaps things weren\u2019t as pleasant as they seemed, it's become a bit eerie.<br>Will you manage to survive? It won't be easy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/9e3d4111f28b78b8df5af54693c827d4.poster.avif?t=1739795156\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/9e3d4111f28b78b8df5af54693c827d4.webm?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177920/extras/9e3d4111f28b78b8df5af54693c827d4.mp4?t=1739795156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "COME TO THIS COZY FARM! Plant crops, take care of the plants, go fishing, or whatever you prefer, but have a good time! But be carefull, they say that strange things are happening in the area...",
